        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "c. 25 Acres of Agricultural Land and shared turbary/commonage of 380 Acres for Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nTitle:   Freehold -  Folios SL13800.\r\n\r\nThe farmland has potential for a variety of agricultural enterprises.  Approx 16 acres of the holding is in one division with the remainder in two separate lots nearby.\r\n\r\nThe main parcel is adjacent to the River Moy while the remaining two lots are adjacent to the Owengarve and Inagh Rivers respectively which are renowned for salmon and trout fishing.\r\n\r\nThe land, on which extensive drainage was carried out in the past, has been actively farmed in recent years.  It could be classified as of good quality\r\ngenerally and is suitable for cattle, sheep and equine grazing.  There is a water supply to the land."
